  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Expanding gives \\(x^3+(a+2)x^2+(b+2a)x+2b\\). The coefficient of the \\(x^2\\) term satisfies \\(a+2=0\\), giving \\(a=-2\\). The coefficient of the \\(x\\) term satisfies \\(b+2a=0\\), giving \\(b=4\\).",
